{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"d2af55bf842dfafe4f0fb35e767a1a40ad7fc5851b4e9aea5f3abeecc2a96bb7","ja":"ふっふっふ……さーて、そろそろ『アレ』の\n最終調整を……と。冷蔵庫を……ぱかッ♪","zh":"嘿嘿嘿……好了，差不多该进行『那个』的最终调整……嗯。打开冰箱……啪♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"a89927103595f450daa0bc8c0d533bc07204634448c33f7616087f11ca4a7003","ja":"えーっと……、確かこの辺に……。\n……あれ！？　あれ、あれ、あれ？","zh":"呃……我记得应该就在这附近……。\n……咦！？　咦、咦、咦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"59e8bede415cbea7a831da0743ca3191e36259bf9e2e1e31f584ded1e10a4ba7","ja":"な、ない～～～～～！？","zh":"不、不可能～～～～～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bb9cd18de89debf4a09b565bb18609472bffe77003c089b756491bb1e89dad66","ja":"な、なになに！？\nどしたの茜～！","zh":"什、什么什么！？\n怎么了，茜～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"615131917a1fc63f8af73ef78dc18ff8810e9f51306543d4cb807a4c2bba47bc","ja":"恵美ちゃん……だ、大事件だよ……！","zh":"惠美……这、这是大事件啊……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b57e09fdb6a2648ddaefe8ad0128551664378adb011542f8c27f9be1048ee797","ja":"冷蔵庫に入れといた『手のひら茜ちゃんチョコ』が\nなくなっちゃってるの！","zh":"放进冰箱的『掌心小茜巧克力』\n不见了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5bc966882ba05a58266a37b5972e6a37ee41a82d75f66f8f00dd6bffc895e137","ja":"えっ？　それってバレンタインのときの\n『巨大茜ちゃんチョコ』の仲間みたいな物？","zh":"咦？那和情人节时的\n『巨大小茜巧克力』是同类吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"2b26be1322e9519038ccce868a0a585db1d3866dbd25c8990dd9591966f5f891","ja":"うん。商品化を目指して\n小型化の試作品を作ってたんだよ。","zh":"嗯。为了商品化，\n我一直在做小型化的试作品。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"14fc70d496f6d47e71f6677cbac21c9be05945bb6c1af4525502cbfae439887b","ja":"赤い箱に入れて、「食べちゃダメだよ！」って\nメモも貼ってたのに……。","zh":"明明放进了红色的盒子里，还贴了“不能吃哦！”的便签……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b9a0de07157caae74a627262406961ec70d2e6e60111b2e892c2875a73050557","ja":"食べられちゃったのかな？　茜ちゃんチョコが\n愛くるしいばっかりに……。カワイイは罪だよねっ！","zh":"是不是被吃掉了呢？　小茜巧克力\n就因为它太可爱了……。可爱就是罪啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"14a5e7c7a052c45fb5371d21d8b82325e75e2021eeeb3c0b97c18d3188b19e2f","ja":"そ、そうだね。……でも、メモも付いてたなら\nさすがに誰も食べないと思うよ？","zh":"也、也是。……不过，要是还附了张便条\n我想应该没人会吃吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"f64df40a248b228c8a4eaeec137e9bd4bedf820a2718d99ae44c7f9a4d99efb5","ja":"ううん！　たとえ名前を書いてたって、\n安全とは限らないんだよ！　茜ちゃんは知っている！","zh":"不对！就算写了名字，\n也不一定安全哦！小茜是知道的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"17b8c183fc654462798665b8f8571530ce6fc7d814ec1def2821fdb8cb0d6e3a","ja":"そ、そっか～……ま、とにかくもうちょい探そ？\nアタシも手伝うからさ！","zh":"这、这样啊～……总之再找找看吧？\n我也会帮忙的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"afb5cdc46f6ef5facc1dc289d041c87c53c69ce286ca20768a13ec5e93539641","ja":"恵美ちゃ～ん！　うん、そうだね！\nまだ諦めるのは早い！","zh":"惠美——！　嗯，没错！\n现在放弃还太早！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_999.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"35581101dfe339e486ee817d8781d760d28dbf1d5291416f4c61c4850c610f72","ja":"俄然やる気が出てきたよ！　消えたチョコ……\n必ず名探偵茜ちゃんが探し出してみせるっ！","zh":"突然来干劲了！　消失的巧克力……\n名侦探小茜一定会把它找出来的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
